      "title": "Twenty-one and up",
      "explanation": [
        "**en** = and.",
        "From 21, Afrikaans says the units first: **een-en-twintig** = one-and-twenty = 21. **vyf-en-dertig** = 35.",
        "Tens: **twintig** (20), **dertig** (30), **veertig** (40), **vyftig** (50), **sestig** (60).",
        "**honderd** = 100."
      ],
      "examples": [
